{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":43.810001373291016,"text":"Great art collections usually gather in capital cities. Rhodes did something unusual. From the 1960s onwards, it began buying work by Greek painters of its own day, steadily, year after year. The result is one of the most important collections of 20th century Greek painting outside Athens, housed in buildings in the Old Town. You will find landscapes, portraits, seas, abstract work, prints. For a child, the interesting part is not the names, but the order. You walk through a century and watch painting change, from pictures trying to look like photographs to pictures that do not want to look like anything at all. Neither kind is more correct than the other, and no painter woke up one morning and decided to change century.","words":[{"word":"Great","start":0,"end":0.6399999856948853},{"word":"art","start":0.6399999856948853,"end":0.9599999785423279},{"word":"collections","start":0.9599999785423279,"end":1.3799999952316284},{"word":"usually","start":1.3799999952316284,"end":2.0399999618530273},{"word":"gather","start":2.0399999618530273,"end":2.2799999713897705},{"word":"in","start":2.2799999713897705,"end":2.5799999237060547},{"word":"capital","start":2.5799999237060547,"end":2.9000000953674316},{"word":"cities","start":2.9000000953674316,"end":3.259999990463257},{"word":"Rhodes","start":4.28000020980835,"end":4.28000020980835},{"word":"did","start":4.28000020980835,"end":4.539999961853027},{"word":"something","start":4.539999961853027,"end":4.920000076293945},{"word":"unusual","start":4.920000076293945,"end":5.360000133514404},{"word":"From","start":6.059999942779541,"end":6.079999923706055},{"word":"the","start":6.079999923706055,"end":6.420000076293945},{"word":"1960s","start":6.420000076293945,"end":7.079999923706055},{"word":"onwards","start":7.079999923706055,"end":7.559999942779541},{"word":"it","start":7.71999979019165,"end":7.860000133514404},{"word":"began","start":7.860000133514